{{Term/Store|Extremely Hot Zone|Extremely Hot Zones|Series, BotW|plural}} are a recurring mechanic in {{TLoZ Series}}.{{Exp Game|BotW}}<ref>{{Cite|Yes, nobody would dare! And not only that, but it's an {{Color BotW|Blue|extremely hot zone}}, so we wouldn't last long there in our gear...|Kotta|BotW}}</ref> Extremely Hot Zones go unnamed in {{TotK}}.

==Overview==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Stub|BotW}}
Extremely Hot Zones are areas of the [[Gerudo Desert]] with such a high degree of [[Heat]] that they require two levels of [[Heat Resistance]] to be safe in. This includes the southern and western portions of the Desert, where daytime [[Temperature]]s frequently rise above 122°F.

